WEBVTT

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.170
Where are we?

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.380
Why are we here?

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.220
Oh, right, we're house-hunting.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.930
It's been quite the while
since I visited this lot.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.300
I'd forgotten how cold it is.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.010
<i>You </i>look toasty warm.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.770
I've prepared some winter wear
for you as well, Letty.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.890
Really?!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.940
Though there weren't
many options in your size.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.230
As long as it's warm, I don't care!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.690
This is warm, but hard to move in.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:12.270
RED DRAGON

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.570
This might be a little too flashy for me.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.740
Now I'm even colder!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:21.080
This is warm, and I can move
my arms and everything!

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.040
He looks like a crab cream croquette.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:26.040
So why are we out in the
middle of a big field of snow?

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.880
You wish to live in peace and quiet, yes?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:33.550
As such, I knew this would be perfect:
no heroes, cheap land price,

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.680
and very, <i>very </i>isolated.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.140
You sure like to take things
to the extreme, huh, Dearia?

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.270
I don't see any buildings
around here, though.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.690
That is because you will build one.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.600
Right here.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.180
Land for Sale

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.350
Right here?!

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:49.860
Here you are.

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:50.690
A shovel?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.070
Indeed.

